       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.          TRPTOVER.
       AUTHOR.              FRED HAYNES.
       DATE-WRITTEN.        FEB 1,1980.
       DATE-COMPILED.
       INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
       SECURITY.
      *D
      *D                    OVERAGE  (OVER MAX).
      *D
      *C              ON NOV 12, 1981
      *C                 1. ADDED LOGIC TO SORT BY CLASS AND BREAK
      *C                    THE REPORT ON CLASS GIVING CLASS TOTALS
      *C                    FOR OVERAGE.
      *C                     KURT MOVSESIAN.
      *C
      *C                 2. NOTE MUST BE PREP WITH MAXDATA=25000.
      *C
      *C
      *C              ON JUNE 13,1983    C.A.KRIST.
      *C                 1. ADDED A FRONT-END PROGRAM TR30SCRN
      *C                    TO ACCEPT DESIRED NUMBER OF MONTHS
      *C                    FOR PROJECTION, UP TO 99.  A PRO-
      *C                    JECTION OF "00" MONTHS WILL RESULT
      *C                    IN A REPORT FOR THE CURRENT OVERAGE.
      *C
      *C                 2. THE R30-FILE THAT IS WRITTEN BY THE
      *C                    FRONT-END PROGRAM IS READ AND THEN
      *C                    PURGED.  IF THE R30-MONTHS = "XX" THEN
      *C                    THE USER EXITED THE PROGRAM WITH AN
      *C                    F8 SO THIS PROGRAM WILL IMMEDIATELY
      *C                    GOBACK AS SOON AS THE R30-FILE IS
      *C                    PURGED; THE DATABASE IS NOT OPENED
      *C                    AND NO WORK IS DONE.
      *C
      *C                 3. OBSOLETE ITEMS HAVE BEEN REMOVED
      *C                    FROM THIS REPORT. THESE ARE ITEMS
      *C                    WITH STR-STOCK-OT NOT = " ".
      *C                    THIS IS THE MOST RECENT VERSION AS
      *C                    REQUESTED BY DENNY UTTERBACK IN
      *C                    DANVILLE AND SHOULD BE IN ALL PLANTS.
      *C
      *C   ON DECEMBER 6, 1984, CHANGED THIS REPORT TO DO AN ACCEPT
      *C   FROM THE JOB STREAM FOR ITS OPTION PARAMETERS, RATHER THAN
      *C   READ AND PURGE A FILE.  THE JOB STREAM FOR THE REPORT IS NOW
      *C   CREATED INTERACTIVELY BY THE OPTION PROGRAM.  ALSO ADDED AN
      *C   OPTION TO PRINT ONLY THOSE ITEMS WITH A CERTAIN MINIMUM
      *C   OVERAGE DOLLAR VALUE SPECIFIED BY THE USER.  CIH.
      *C
      *C   ON DECEMBER 14, 1984, CHANGED ADDED THE FOLLOWING OPTIONS
      *C   TO THIS PROGRAM:
      *C     1.  USER MAY NOW REPORT ON ONLY OVERAGE THAT EXCEEDS A
      *C         CERTAIN DOLLAR VALUE (SPECIFIED IN OPTION PROGRAM).
      *C     2.  USER MAY NOW EXCLUDE ITEMS THAT MAY HAVE APPEARED
      *C         ON AN EARLIER OBSOLETE ITEMS REPORT.  THE MINIMUM
      *C         VALUE FOR OBSOLETE ITEMS TO EXCLUDE IS ENTERED BY THE
      *C         USER.
      *C     3.  USER MAY NOW EXCLUDE ITEMS THAT MAY HAVE APPEARED
      *C         ON AN EARLIER SLOW MOVER REPORT.  THE MINIMUM VALUE
      *C         FOR SLOW MOVERS TO EXCLUDE, AND THE SLOW MOVER DATE OF
      *C         THE EARLIER REPORT, MUST BE ENTERED.
      *C
      *C   ON DECEMBER 26, 1984, MADE THE FOLLOWING CHANGES:
      *C     1.  TOOK OUT ALL HEADER PAGE LOGIC AND HEADER AREAS,
      *C     AND REPLACED THIS WITH A CALL TO THE SUBPROGRAM "THDPRT2",
      *C     WHICH WILL PRINT THE HEADER PAGE, ALONG WITH ROUTING
      *C     INFORMATION.
      *C     2.  ADDED AN ACCEPT OF ROUTING DATA WHICH IS PROVIDED
      *C     BY THE OPTION PROGRAM.
      *C     3.  REORGANIZED THE WORKING STORAGE AREA.
      *C     4.  ELIMINATED "TR30SCRN" AS THE OPTION PROGRAM.
      *C     "TRSCREEN" WILL NOW BE THE OPTION PROGRAM ("TRSCREEN" IS A
      *C     UNIVERSAL REPORT OPTION PROGRAM WHICH WILL HANDLE MANY
      *C     REPORTS).
      *C     CIH.
      *C
      *C      ADDED INTERNATIONAL DATE ROUTINE "TDATECHK" ON
      *C      MAY 22, 1985.    V.W.D.
      *C
      *C      MAY 23, 1986
      *C      ADDED ABILITY TO REPORT ON INSURANCE ITEMS ONLY.
      *C                          ANNETTE KRAUSS.
      *C
      *C      DECEMBER 4, 1986
      *C      EXPANDED THE SIZE OF ALL COST/PRICE FIELDS TO CONFORM
      *C      TO THE NEW DATABASE STRUCTURE.  ALSO ADDED COPYLIB FOR
      *C      ALL DATABASE BUFFER AREAS.
      *C                                 D.A. PLUM.
      *C
      *C      ON FEB 9,1987
      *C      ADDED CALL TO 'CDESC' TO GET FULL DESCRIPTION.
      *C      REPLACED CALLS TO DBEXPLAIN WITH CALL TO
      *C      SUBPROGRAM 'TBLOWUP'.    C.J.R.
      *C
      *C  CR KALMAN        4/26/94            REQUEST 6490
      *C  REMOVED PORTABLILITY COPYLIBS.
      *C  JUNE 23, 1994   CR KALMAN
      *C   ADDED CALL TO COBOL ERROR HANDLER -MCXCBLERR.
      *C
      *C  09/13/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C   EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C   INCLUDE CENTURY ON SLOW MOVER COMPARISONS.
      *C
      *C  08/11/1997   CA YODER     REQ #95-015
      *C    MODIFIED PROGRAM TO ACCEPT AND USE THE NEW OPTIONS ADDED
      *C    TO THE MATERIALS CONTROL REPORTS.
      *C    NOTE:  THIS PROGRAM NOW USES COPYLIB MEMBERS FOR MOST OF
      *C           ITS PROCESSING LOGIC.  TO SEE ALL OF THE MEMBERS,
      *C           LOOK IN COPYLIB FOR THE FILES THAT START WITH THE
      *C           PREFIX "MTLS".
      *C


       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.          I-O-FEEDBACK     IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA
                               LOCAL-DATA       IS LOCAL-DATA-AREA
                               C01 IS NEW-PAGE.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT ONLINE-PRT ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT.
           SELECT SORT-FILE  ASSIGN TO DISK-SORT.

           SELECT MSTORERM-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0201
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DDESC-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1401
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                 WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DMANPART-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS3603
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                 WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DVENDITM-CD-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0802
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                 WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DVENDOR-VN-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0701
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                 WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.


       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.

       FD  ONLINE-PRT
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
           RECORD CONTAINS 132 CHARACTERS
           DATA RECORD IS PRINT-RCD.
       01  PRINT-RCD                     PIC X(132).

       COPY MTLSSORT IN COPYLIB.

